<title>JAPAN: Nippon Broadcasting says to revise forecast.</title>
<headline>Nippon Broadcasting says to revise forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Broadcasting System Inc said on Tuesday that it would revise its earnings forecast at 7.40 p.m. (1040 GMT).  </p>
<p>The radio broadcasting company owns 43.7 percent of Japanese broadcaster Fuji Television Network Inc which will be listed on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) on August 8.</p>
<p>The TSE said on Tuesday that Fuji Television's initial share offer price was set at 550,000 yen.</p>
